      "In her role as a trainer, Lieutenant Doha is keen to inspire female trainees by preparing a strong and confident generation capable of carrying responsibility in the field.",
      "Alongside her professional success, she continued her academic journey and earned a Master’s degree in Public Relations and Corporate Communication. She later remarried and was blessed with two daughters, completing a close and supportive family life after years of hardship.",
