      "During the ceremony, Al Marri also honoured Brigadier Nasser Hamid Al Zari in appreciation of his significant role and continuous support for Lieutenant Doha throughout her career. His leadership, field follow up, and belief in empowering female cadres have contributed to creating a motivating training environment where talent can thrive.",
